        n=0:     1      1   OK
        n=1:     0      0   OK
        n=2:     0      0   OK
        n=3:     0      0   OK
        n=4:     0      0   OK
        n=5:     0      0   OK
        n=6:    -1     -1   OK
        n=7:    -6     -6   OK
        n=8:   -21    -21   OK
        n=9:   -56    -56   OK
   => T5 = +1 at n=0, ZERO for 1<=n<=5, negative (=-C(n-1,5)) for n>=6.

