(3) THE BASE LEMMA (clean ruler): if max_p bandCount(v,q,p) <= 5 and liveCount(q) >= 1,
    then PENALTY=0 so B5(v,q) = liveCount(q) > 0.  Reduces the depth-5 obligation to:
    'a live multiplier with no multiplier covering >= 6 runners' -- transparent + Lean-friendly.
